4.avif?t=1762091963\" width=672 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the night, invaders will approach your borders, maintain your kingdom and order your troops. Each unit has their own strengths and weaknesses, so strategize accordingly! Defend enough, and you'll be able to expand your colony, but doing so puts you at risk of further angering your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/a53943d5f07d14bd8623d0941c74197c.poster.avif?t=1762091963\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/a53943d5f07d14bd8623d0941c74197c.webm?t=1762091963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/a53943d5f07d14bd8623d0941c74197c.mp4?t=1762091963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/55ca8ea136a5aa36b20f29640f9aca32.avif?t=1762091963\" width=672 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your colony grows, improve your army! Send them on expeditions to gain permanent buffs, train them by merging cards, or order them in combat with special decrees. Upgrade wisely in order to prevail over your enemies and protect your title as<strong> Critterking</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/ef27b21b5d2c647a1f0c1d775ef73ac4.poster.avif?t=1762091963\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/ef27b21b5d2c647a1f0c1d775ef73ac4.webm?t=1762091963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073470/extras/ef27b21b5d2c647a1f0c1d775ef73ac4.mp4?t=1762091963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
